摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness UI Aqua玻璃质感主题，在原作者基础上对DSH新版本进行适配","id":"gh:1353838298","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"DSH-Transparent-UI-Plugin","slug":"du-u-uck/DSH-Transparent-UI-Plugin","topics":["deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh","dsh-plugin","theme","ui"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness UI Aqua玻璃质感主题，在原作者基础上对DSH新版本进行适配"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-aqua"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"## 本 README 在原作者**英文 README** 与**中文 README** 全文的基础上，于文末新增「**适配 0.1.1-rc.2**」一节，补充了针对新版 DeepSeek Harn"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ess 的 API 改动、我们做的修补，以及**推荐的安装方式**，建议跳转文末阅读。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## 强烈建议把整个仓库文件夹丢给其他Agent，让它帮忙装，如果有问题让它自己修复"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"# 原作者为WYH66666666,github：https://github.com/WYH66666666/DSH-Transparent-UI-Plugin"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 以下为原作者 README 原文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"# @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-aqua"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Aqua is a highly customizable glassmorphism theme for the DeepSeek Harness web UI. The header, sideb"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ar, composer, stats line, and trajectory view all become panes of frosted glass. you can put video f"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"or wallpaper and Switch it off and the stock UI comes back exactly, with no source changes to DSH it"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"llpaper and Switch it off and the stock UI comes back exactly, with no source changes to DSH itself."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **Two modes**: **Mica** restyles the layout into floating glass cards (blur and frost adjustable),"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" while **Compatibility Mode** keeps the stock layout byte-for-byte and only swaps the material to ge"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"neric glass — other plugins' UI gets the same treatment automatically\n- **Free backdrop**: a living "},{"id":"p11s4","text":"fluid board (hue adjustable) or your own wallpaper (fills the page, aspect preserved, with its own b"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"lur and frost); light wallpapers look best in light mode, dark wallpapers in dark mode\n- **Backgroun"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"d brightness**: follows the resolved scheme — dark mode darkens (0–50), light mode brightens (50–100"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"), 50 is unchanged\n- **Particle whale**: the deepseek.com/harness centerpiece fish (a 2D port of the"},{"id":"p11s8","text":" site's particle engine), centered in the chat area right of the sidebar — white particles on dark, "},{"id":"p11s9","text":"gray on light, toggleable in settings\n- **Glossy \"Harness\" badge**: in dark mode the sidebar wordmar"},{"id":"p11s10","text":"k wears the official nameplate pill (135° gradient ring + soft glow); light mode keeps the stock pla"},{"id":"p11s11","text":"te\n- **Edge fades**: 5px gradient blur bands pinned to the top and bottom of the page, above the cha"},{"id":"p11s12","text":"t content — scrolling content melts into the edges; faint white veil on light, faint black on dark\n-"},{"id":"p11s13","text":" One switch: off restores the stock UI exactly, and every effect is removed with the plugin"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Option 1: npm one-liner (recommended)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Installs the latest version from npm and registers it as a profile plugin layer (`dsh.bundle` patch)"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" — works on every platform. Reload the web UI and it is on."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Option 2: GitHub installer (fallback)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"No npm account and no git needed (falls back to a plain zip download)."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**Windows (one command):**"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Installs the **latest release** by default. The script links the plugin into the profile's `node_mod"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ules` and registers `ui-aqua` in `cordis.patch.yml` (idempotent — safe to run again)."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Pin a version or track the dev branch:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**macOS / Linux (manual, three steps):**"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"then append to `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Reload the web UI. Aqua is **on by default**; the master switch lives in **Settings → Plugins → Glas"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"s theme** (same shape as the other plugin cards), and every other control sits directly under **Sett"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ings → General → Appearance** (no title of its own): mode, blur/frost (Mica mode), fluid color, back"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ground brightness, backdrop (fluid/wallpaper) with its wallpaper controls, and the particle-whale to"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"ggle. With the master switch off, the whole control block under Appearance is hidden."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 原作者中文 README（原文）"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"# @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-aqua"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Aqua 是一层高自由度的玻璃质感主题，套在 DeepSeek Harness 网页端。顶栏、侧边栏、输入框、统计行、轨迹视图都成了磨砂玻璃片,你还可以添加视频和图片作为背景。关掉开关就回到原生界面，"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"璃质感主题，套在 DeepSeek Harness 网页端。顶栏、侧边栏、输入框、统计行、轨迹视图都成了磨砂玻璃片,你还可以添加视频和图片作为背景。关掉开关就回到原生界面，不改 DSH 任何一行源码。"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## 特性"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- **双模式**：**云母效果**把布局改成悬浮玻璃卡片（模糊度、磨砂度可调）；**兼容模式**保持原版排版一字不动，只把材质换成通用玻璃，其他插件的界面也会自动玻璃化\n- **背景自由**：流体板"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"（颜色可调）或自定义壁纸（铺满页面、比例不变，可单独调模糊度/磨砂度）；浅色壁纸配浅色模式、深色壁纸配深色模式观感更佳\n- **背景亮度**：自动跟随深浅模式——深色模式 0–50 压暗、浅色模式 5"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"0–100 提亮，50 原样\n- **粒子鲸鱼**：deepseek.com/harness 同款粒子鱼（官网粒子引擎移植），显示在聊天区域正中央（不含侧边栏），深色模式白粒子、浅色模式灰粒子，设置里"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"可开关\n- **Harness 光泽铭牌**：深色模式下侧边栏铭牌换成官网同款「Harness」药丸（135° 渐变描边 + 柔光），浅色模式保持原版铭牌\n- **边缘渐变模糊**：页面顶部/底部各 "},{"id":"p34s5","text":"5px 渐变模糊带，悬浮在聊天内容上层，内容滚到边缘渐入模糊；浅色微泛白、深色微泛黑\n- 一键开关：关闭即完全还原原生界面，所有效果随插件卸载一并消失"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## 安装"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### 方式一：npm 一键安装（推荐）"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"从 npm 安装最新版，自动注册为 profile 插件层（`dsh.bundle` 补丁），所有平台通用。刷新 Web 界面即可。"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"### 方式二：GitHub 安装器（备用）"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"不需要 npm、不需要 git（自动退回 zip 下载）。"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"**Windows（一条命令）：**"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"### 兼容性验证"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"通过一份基于 mock 运行时的冒烟测试（`vm` 沙箱加载 `lib/client.js`，mock 一整套 DSH Web 运行时 + 浏览器 DOM，激活插件后断言新 API 表面）验证："},{"id":"p46s1","text":"- `window.__ModuleLoader__.load` 包裹与内联 CSS 注入完整；\n- `ctx.settingsScope.bind` 被调用且仅调用一次，`namespace ==="},{"id":"p46s2","text":" 'settings.aqua'`；\n- `settings.plugin.item` 以 `key: 'settings.aqua'` 注册且无 `id`（list→keyed 迁移）；\n- `se"},{"id":"p46s3","text":"ttings.general.item` 仍为 `id: 'aqua', order: 11`。"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"全部断言通过。该验证脚本位于完整开发仓库的 `scripts/` 下，未纳入本精简分发包（不影响运行）。"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
